WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.080
Lost your phone? Your bitcoin isn't. There are two ways back.

2
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:19.976
If you have your backup: install Trikey on the new phone, choose I already have a Trikey wallet, open your backup file, and type the recovery code.

3
00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:28.514
Your wallet comes back with the same guardian, rules and contacts. No waiting.

4
00:00:29.314 --> 00:00:38.370
No backup? Your hardware wallet and your guardian can still get you back in. It just takes a few days, on purpose.

5
00:00:38.914 --> 00:00:46.676
On the new phone, start a recovery with your hardware wallet. The guardian waits for the period you chose: at least seven days.

6
00:00:56.014 --> 00:01:03.315
Every day, you and your alert contacts get a message. If you didn't start it, cancel it from any of your devices.

7
00:01:10.064 --> 00:01:15.248
Then, when the wait is over, the guardian co-signs the move to your new wallet.

8
00:01:20.364 --> 00:01:27.436
So, that's the whole setup. One key gone. Your bitcoin isn't.
